# Task Domain

## Primary files

- `src/state/taskStore.supabase.ts`
- Task screens under `src/screens/` (Tasks, Detail, Create, UpdateProgress, AddComment, Reject)
- `src/navigation/AppNavigator.tsx`

## Expectations

- Preserve workflow semantics: create, assign, accept/decline, progress, review, approve/reject, comments, archive/cancel/delete, subtasks
- Inspect store + triggering screen together
- Stay consistent with existing Supabase schema/activity model
- Careful with optimistic updates, realtime refresh, and persisted cache

## Validation

- Prefer `npm run test:tasks` (and related targeted Jest) before broader suites
- User-visible task UX also needs Maestro/QA when interaction-sensitive
